Nintendo Entertainment System emulation uses EmulatorJS
(https://emulatorjs.org) with the FCEUmm libretro core
(https://github.com/EmulatorJS/libretro-fceumm). EmulatorJS is GPL-3.0 (see
../emulatorjs/LICENSE). FCEUmm is GPL-2.0 (see LICENSE.GPL2); retain its
upstream attribution and license terms when redistributing.
